B.bke=new A.bq(B.dy,["1. Platform Overview & Dynamic QR Services","Mport, operated under Maple Pro, provides merchant software for dynamic QR code generation, multi-link mobile profiles, cloud hosting for restaurant PDF menus and catalogs, and custom tabletop acrylic standees. By signing up or subscribing, you agree to these Terms of Service."],t.l)
B.bkf=new A.bq(B.dy,["2. Dynamic Standee Continuity & Uptime SLA","Our dynamic QR routing ensures that once your physical standee is manufactured and printed, you may alter your underlying links, menus, or contact details at any time without rendering the physical QR code obsolete. We target a 99.9% cloud availability rate supported by global CDN infrastructure."],t.l)
B.bkg=new A.bq(B.dy,["3. Subscription Tiers & Voluntary Renewal","All client subscriptions are billed on a non-automatic debit basis. We do NOT store card CVVs or initiate silent auto-debits without explicit consent. When a plan period ends, you are prompted with an in-app renewal notice. You may upgrade, downgrade, or pause service at any time."],t.l)
B.bkb=new A.bq(B.dy,["4. Safe Profile Guarantee","In the event of a subscription expiration, your business profile, menu links, and custom QR configuration are preserved safely on our cloud database. Your profile is never permanently purged, allowing instant restoration whenever you choose to resume service."],t.l)
