B.bk7=new A.bq(B.dy,["1. Merchant Information We Collect","We collect essential merchant credentials required to maintain your account: business name, contact phone number, email address, and optional brand logos or menu PDFs. Financial payment information is handled directly by PCI-DSS compliant Indian payment gateways (Razorpay) and is never stored on our application servers."],t.l)
B.bk4=new A.bq(B.dy,["2. Zero Tracking of End Consumers (Scanners)",'We respect consumer privacy. When patrons or diners scan your table standee, we do NOT collect their personal identity, names, phone numbers, or device tracking IDs. We record purely aggregated, anonymous scan counters (e.g. "Table 4 received 18 scans today") to help you measure footfall.'],t.l)
B.bk9=new A.bq(B.dy,["3. Strict Multi-Tenant Data Isolation","Every business account is segregated using encrypted tenant isolation keys. A merchant has access exclusively to their own profiles, menus, and billing history. No competitor or third party can view your analytics or private merchant settings."],t.l)
B.bk5=new A.bq(B.dy,["4. Data Retention & Deletion Rights","You retain 100% ownership of your media assets and business data. You may request complete account deletion or media purge at any time by contacting our Merchant Concierge desk."],t.l)
